WEBVTT

00:00.034 --> 00:03.834
Episode 14
Gathering

00:23.858 --> 00:27.225
You are the dreamseer from the Dragons of Earth.

00:27.294 --> 00:28.818
Your name...

00:28.896 --> 00:29.988
...Kakyou.

00:31.198 --> 00:32.756
That's right.

00:32.833 --> 00:37.293
If you guide the Dragon of Earth Kamui, what happens...

00:37.371 --> 00:38.463
I know.

00:39.774 --> 00:42.208
Just as you know everything.

00:43.944 --> 00:46.276
I have a wish, as well.

00:46.347 --> 00:49.783
I decided to weave dreams for that one wish.

00:50.851 --> 00:52.512
For a wish?

00:52.586 --> 00:54.247
Yes.

00:54.321 --> 00:57.017
I know what your wish is, too.

00:58.626 --> 01:03.689
And that you have been fooling people for that wish.

01:09.837 --> 01:11.429
Do you believe it?

01:12.506 --> 01:17.239
Those words of that girl who was incomplete as a dreamseer.

01:17.311 --> 01:20.803
The future still hasn't been determined.

01:24.151 --> 01:28.520
A dreamseer can see the future but cannot change it.

01:29.957 --> 01:32.221
You should know that well enough.

01:33.294 --> 01:34.386
I know.

01:35.963 --> 01:37.590
But...

01:37.665 --> 01:39.428
But still, I...

01:40.601 --> 01:41.795
Still...

02:27.982 --> 02:29.779
Did I interrupt something?

02:29.850 --> 02:31.511
No.

02:31.585 --> 02:35.419
I heard you asked the chairman of the school...

02:35.489 --> 02:37.548
...to bury Kotori's remains here.

02:38.626 --> 02:40.321
It's a nice, quiet place.

02:42.129 --> 02:43.721
Sorry...

02:43.797 --> 02:45.560
If something happened...

02:45.633 --> 02:48.534
...I bragged I'd sacrifice myself to help you.

02:48.602 --> 02:51.332
In the end, I couldn't do anything.

02:53.307 --> 02:54.774
Sorry.

02:54.842 --> 02:56.537
No, that's not true.

02:57.611 --> 02:59.841
It's because I didn't trust you all.

03:03.017 --> 03:05.451
But it'll be different from now on.

03:09.790 --> 03:11.758
Can I pay my respects?

03:14.028 --> 03:15.655
Can we, as well?

03:19.166 --> 03:21.293
Mind if I join you?

03:22.369 --> 03:24.394
Sure, Kotori would be happy.

03:40.454 --> 03:44.185
If you don't mind, can you tell me your names?

03:45.259 --> 03:47.056
I'm Karen Kasumi.

03:48.796 --> 03:49.854
That's true.

03:49.930 --> 03:53.388
There are some of us that haven't been introduced.

03:53.467 --> 03:56.265
I'm Sorata Arisugawa from Kouya.

03:56.337 --> 03:58.862
Arashi Kishu, Ise Shrine.

03:58.939 --> 04:02.238
I'm Yuzuriha Nekoi from Mitsumine Shrine.

04:02.309 --> 04:04.004
And this is Inuki.

04:05.079 --> 04:07.912
Subaru Sumeragi, Sumeragi clan.

04:07.982 --> 04:11.145
Seiichiro Aoki of the windmaster family.

04:11.218 --> 04:12.845
I work for a publisher.

04:14.355 --> 04:15.287
You're...

04:16.624 --> 04:18.353
Oh, hello.

04:18.425 --> 04:19.824
You know each other?

04:20.995 --> 04:21.984
Um...

04:22.062 --> 04:25.054
He came as a customer to my workplace.

04:26.200 --> 04:27.861
Workplace?

04:27.935 --> 04:30.733
It was research for an author under me...

04:30.804 --> 04:31.964
You're kidding me!

04:33.407 --> 04:34.999
And you are...

04:36.076 --> 04:38.203
...the seventh Dragon of Heaven.

04:40.914 --> 04:42.347
Kamui Shirou.

04:43.450 --> 04:46.283
This means that we are all here now.

04:46.353 --> 04:49.345
The Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals...

05:04.972 --> 05:08.567
The Divine Sword that Tokiko gave birth to...

05:08.642 --> 05:10.769
Did you hear her message?

05:10.844 --> 05:12.072
Yeah.

05:12.146 --> 05:15.604
Take this Divine Sword, and until the Promised Day...

05:15.683 --> 05:19.016
...hide it in the center of the pentagram.

05:19.086 --> 05:21.281
In the center of the pentagram.

05:22.523 --> 05:24.582
The center of the pentagram?

05:24.658 --> 05:27.650
That means in the middle of this campus?

05:27.728 --> 05:29.525
That is correct.

05:29.596 --> 05:31.791
I will guide you.

05:31.865 --> 05:34.197
To where the Divine Sword will be sealed.

05:34.268 --> 05:36.327
The center of the pentagram.

05:52.086 --> 05:54.111
Now move forward.

06:34.394 --> 06:37.557
Amazing!
It's like a robot launch base!

06:41.335 --> 06:46.204
This campus town is created using various occult knowledge.

06:47.407 --> 06:50.968
The main street running in the shape of a pentagram...

06:51.044 --> 06:52.671
...serves as one barrier.

06:54.948 --> 06:57.917
Who in the world made such a big deal?

06:57.985 --> 06:59.919
The former chairman.

06:59.987 --> 07:04.014
I heard Princess Hinoto was involved with this place's design.

07:04.091 --> 07:05.558
The princess?

07:05.626 --> 07:06.650
Yes.

07:06.727 --> 07:09.287
It seems that many people...

07:09.363 --> 07:12.764
...supporting this country from shadow put in their powers.

07:18.539 --> 07:20.769
This is the pentagram's center.

07:22.609 --> 07:25.601
The place where the Divine Sword will lie dormant.

07:30.517 --> 07:34.351
What's the reason for sealing away the Divine Sword?

07:34.421 --> 07:37.390
To seal the other Divine Sword's powers.

07:39.226 --> 07:40.750
The other Divine Sword?

07:40.828 --> 07:44.559
The Divine Sword is such
that only "Kamui" can wield it.

07:44.631 --> 07:47.930
You can put its immense powers to good use,

07:48.001 --> 07:51.493
but we don't even know where the other one is.

07:51.572 --> 07:55.201
So there is a need to seal away its powers...

07:55.275 --> 07:57.300
...until the promised day.

07:57.377 --> 07:59.845
If you seal this Divine Sword there...

07:59.913 --> 08:04.043
...you can seal the powers of the other one in the same way.

08:05.919 --> 08:09.753
The Divine Sword is such that only "Kamui" can wield it.

08:10.824 --> 08:13.418
What are you talking about, Fuma?

08:13.493 --> 08:15.051
Two Divine Swords...

08:15.128 --> 08:16.857
Two futures...

08:16.930 --> 08:19.421
I am your twin star.

08:19.499 --> 08:20.431
Fuma?

08:23.704 --> 08:27.003
I am the other "Kamui"!

08:53.367 --> 08:54.527
What's this noise?

09:05.712 --> 09:06.872
W-What's that?

09:15.422 --> 09:16.650
What's going on?

09:21.194 --> 09:22.752
Hurry up and seal it!

09:22.829 --> 09:26.390
The two Divine Swords may be calling out for each other!

10:34.801 --> 10:37.133
He sealed the Divine Sword away.

10:49.916 --> 10:53.784
Do you know that the place where we belong...

10:54.855 --> 10:56.015
...is not here.

11:03.530 --> 11:05.430
Let's go together.

11:08.802 --> 11:10.326
It's been a while.

11:10.404 --> 11:12.372
How things have changed around here.

11:12.439 --> 11:14.373
Especially underground.

11:16.309 --> 11:19.574
Looks like both Kamuis have finally awakened.

11:19.646 --> 11:22.444
I guess I'll say hello at least once.

11:29.389 --> 11:32.415
He has something dangerous with him.

11:32.492 --> 11:35.928
That must be a Dragon of Earth, one of my comrades.

11:37.330 --> 11:38.797
It's finally time.

11:38.865 --> 11:40.730
Though I'm not really into this...

11:43.570 --> 11:46.437
It looks like the Divine Sword has been sealed.

11:46.506 --> 11:50.772
There are those who realize that and are headed here.

11:50.844 --> 11:54.371
Three men of the Dragons of Earth.

11:54.448 --> 11:55.813
And...

11:55.882 --> 11:57.247
...my Divine Sword.

12:28.448 --> 12:32.316
This school will make sure to protect the Divine Sword.

12:32.385 --> 12:35.047
Until the day that you need it.

12:35.655 --> 12:37.122
Please.

12:37.190 --> 12:39.283
I'm going to see Hinoto.

12:39.359 --> 12:42.157
There's something that I just have to ask her.

12:51.138 --> 12:53.629
I have been waiting for you.

12:53.707 --> 12:54.799
Please come in.

12:59.946 --> 13:04.576
Now all the Seven Seals, the Dragons of Heaven...

13:04.651 --> 13:06.414
...have gathered here.

13:07.821 --> 13:12.019
The windmaster and the flamemaster.

13:12.092 --> 13:15.255
And one of the Sumeragi clan.

13:16.763 --> 13:21.097
I would also like to express my thanks for saving Kamui.

13:22.202 --> 13:24.102
The recent events...

13:24.171 --> 13:27.698
I have heard of them from Lady Arashi and Lord Saiki.

13:27.774 --> 13:29.742
All the horrible events.

13:30.810 --> 13:31.902
Hinoto...

13:33.313 --> 13:34.678
It's all right.

13:34.748 --> 13:36.978
I trust Kamui.

13:37.050 --> 13:39.075
You also trust the princess, right?

13:40.887 --> 13:42.821
Both of you, stand down.

13:52.866 --> 13:55.892
You said you can see the future in your dreams.

13:57.671 --> 14:00.765
If you know what happens in the future...

14:00.840 --> 14:04.674
...did you know what was going to happen to Kotori and Fuma?

14:07.247 --> 14:09.147
Why are you quiet?

14:09.216 --> 14:12.879
You didn't tell me the most important thing.

14:13.954 --> 14:14.886
Why?

14:17.924 --> 14:20.017
I had known...

14:20.093 --> 14:21.685
...about that girl's death.

14:22.762 --> 14:25.060
Kamui, I know how you feel.

14:25.131 --> 14:28.225
But there's a reason Princess Hinoto couldn't say.

14:28.301 --> 14:32.260
Princess, when you think about it, we really understand!

14:32.339 --> 14:37.504
And we all gathered for something we need to risk our lives over!

14:37.577 --> 14:40.102
We have to trust each other!

14:40.180 --> 14:41.112
Right?

14:42.916 --> 14:44.816
As you all say...

14:44.884 --> 14:45.976
But...

14:46.052 --> 14:47.519
It is all right.

14:47.587 --> 14:48.679
However...

14:51.858 --> 14:55.288
Daisuke, it's the thought of trusting each other.

15:02.302 --> 15:04.361
Let me tell you a story.

15:04.437 --> 15:07.770
Everything has flowed, guided by destiny.

15:07.841 --> 15:12.403
Your mother passed away as your shadow sacrifice.

15:12.479 --> 15:15.971
And following her last will, you returned to Tokyo.

15:17.050 --> 15:19.883
But the Divine Sword you sought was stolen...

15:19.953 --> 15:24.617
...and the priest guarding it at Togakushi Shrine passed away.

15:24.691 --> 15:27.717
Your aunt, Lady Tokiko Magami...

15:27.794 --> 15:31.195
...gave birth to a new Divine Sword and passed away.

15:31.264 --> 15:33.630
And finally, even that girl...

15:35.368 --> 15:40.305
Many people around you have thrown themselves into cruel fates.

15:40.373 --> 15:43.308
I don't want to believe in destiny.

15:43.376 --> 15:49.508
As I told you before, you had two futures.

15:51.418 --> 15:54.546
One as a Dragon of Heaven to protect the present...

15:54.621 --> 15:58.387
...and one as a Dragon of Earth to wish for a change.

15:58.458 --> 16:02.258
And you have selected one of the two.

16:03.496 --> 16:07.364
I don't know about what should happen to the world.

16:07.434 --> 16:11.803
It doesn't matter to me whether I'm a Dragon of Heaven or Earth.

16:12.906 --> 16:14.237
I just...

16:14.307 --> 16:18.004
I just want Kotori and Fuma to be happy.

16:19.612 --> 16:23.446
I want to protect the place where they can live happily.

16:23.516 --> 16:24.608
That's all.

16:33.326 --> 16:34.759
It seems you've chosen.

16:36.429 --> 16:39.159
The present over a revolution.

16:39.232 --> 16:40.164
Fuma...

16:40.233 --> 16:43.600
One of the Seven Seals, a Dragon of Heaven's future.

16:43.670 --> 16:44.728
You chose.

16:46.406 --> 16:49.341
When you chose the Dragons of Heaven...

16:49.409 --> 16:52.173
...the other "Kamui" was born.

16:52.245 --> 16:54.076
The other "Kamui"?

16:55.148 --> 16:56.638
Yes.

16:56.716 --> 16:58.513
The Dragon of Earth "Kamui."

16:58.585 --> 17:03.648
The two Divine Swords meant that there existed two "Kamuis."

17:04.691 --> 17:06.625
Two "Kamuis"?

17:06.693 --> 17:08.957
That young man named Fuma...

17:09.028 --> 17:13.158
He was born with the destiny of being your twin star.

17:16.369 --> 17:20.567
You should have realized it at least a little bit.

17:20.640 --> 17:24.337
That his other personality had begun to surface.

17:25.412 --> 17:26.436
Kamui...

17:27.514 --> 17:28.879
I am your...

17:30.283 --> 17:31.215
...twin star.

17:38.758 --> 17:44.287
He was the twin star born to ensure the empty seat was filled...

17:44.364 --> 17:48.630
...when you, the true "Kamui", decided on heaven or earth.

17:49.702 --> 17:53.001
That is your and that young man's destiny.

17:58.011 --> 17:59.410
If...

17:59.479 --> 18:02.744
If I had chosen to be
a Dragon of Earth...

18:02.816 --> 18:05.944
...would Fuma and Kotori have been spared from this?

18:07.187 --> 18:08.119
No.

18:09.222 --> 18:12.749
Your personality would have been lost then...

18:12.826 --> 18:15.659
...and you would have killed that girl.

18:15.728 --> 18:17.457
I'd kill Kotori...

18:17.530 --> 18:18.792
It can't be...

18:20.500 --> 18:26.405
That girl's destiny was to be killed by one of the two "Kamuis."

18:26.473 --> 18:32.002
There was no way that I could tell you such a horrible thing.

18:33.146 --> 18:35.341
Please forgive me.

18:49.095 --> 18:50.221
Hinoto...

18:51.297 --> 18:52.889
Yes...

18:52.966 --> 18:54.558
Tell me one more thing.

18:55.802 --> 18:57.463
Fuma...

18:57.537 --> 18:59.971
Can I bring back his old self?

19:00.039 --> 19:03.975
That is one thing that even I do not know.

19:05.044 --> 19:08.639
But if he returns to the identity you know as Fuma...

19:08.715 --> 19:12.981
...he will also be reminded of the fact that he killed that girl.

19:14.254 --> 19:15.346
I see.

19:17.056 --> 19:19.752
But I've decided.

19:19.826 --> 19:23.387
That I'll make sure to bring Fuma back to his old self.

19:24.464 --> 19:27.126
I heard what I wanted to hear.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.132
Thanks.

19:30.870 --> 19:33.202
You say everything is destined,

19:33.273 --> 19:34.797
but I don't believe it.

19:36.609 --> 19:39.510
I'll decide my own future.

20:16.916 --> 20:19.180
It seems they're all gathered now.

20:19.252 --> 20:21.880
The Dragons of Heaven, the Seven Seals...

20:21.955 --> 20:25.220
...and the Dragons of Earth, the Seven Angels.

20:25.291 --> 20:26.986
It will finally begin.

20:27.060 --> 20:30.962
The final battle that has the entire world at stake.

20:31.030 --> 20:34.193
Are you looking forward to it, Hinoto, my sister?
